OL,3,GNEWSAMan finishes 62-mile cricket
OL,4,Arun-up record attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm very tired, I lost a lot of sleep,
OL,7,Fbut it was all for an amazing cause,"
OL,8,FBodoano said.
